{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the plant shop of your dreams in Leafy Corner, a cozy shop management game where you grow, sell, and care for real-life houseplants!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/87b14979431af180cabe905f58246b68.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/87b14979431af180cabe905f58246b68.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/87b14979431af180cabe905f58246b68.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a plant shop owner. Grow plants, serve your customers, and create a warm, inviting space filled with greenery and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/712a65fdeec47abdb1c2467720967f63.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/712a65fdeec47abdb1c2467720967f63.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/712a65fdeec47abdb1c2467720967f63.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your plants grow over time, unfolding leaf by leaf as you care for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/533e648e4be05038120df19dee981034.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/533e648e4be05038120df19dee981034.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/533e648e4be05038120df19dee981034.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone knows what they\u2019re looking for. Sometimes customers bring unusual or tricky requests. Finding just the right plant to fit their needs adds a fun challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/7e8949aa6e2f3ab6836b3aa38ba18a75.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/7e8949aa6e2f3ab6836b3aa38ba18a75.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/7e8949aa6e2f3ab6836b3aa38ba18a75.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your shop with a variety of unlockable items, from shelves to plant pots. Pick colors that fit your mood and create a space that reflects your unique style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, care for, and sell 100+ unique plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover plant variegations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your shop with a variety of pots, furniture, and decoration options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill orders and help customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks to progress your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your shop\u2019s reputation to unlock new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are working hard and pouring our hearts into making Leafy Corner. You can support us by wishlisting and following the game on Steam. And if you want to chat with us or fellow plant lovers, you can find us on Discord!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558600?t=1774106944","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/1bf38a8c247ae3076c09670b64ffd7aaa7d4bdc6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774106944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/8d425ec50f24514449ed1f945a49df6bf3c46ab2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774106944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/8d425ec50f24514449ed1f945a49df6bf3c46ab2/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774106944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the plant shop of your dreams in Leafy Corner, a cozy shop management game where you grow, sell, and care for real-life houseplants!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/87b14979431af180cabe905f58246b68.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/87b14979431af180cabe905f58246b68.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/87b14979431af180cabe905f58246b68.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a plant shop owner. Grow plants, serve your customers, and create a warm, inviting space filled with greenery and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/712a65fdeec47abdb1c2467720967f63.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/712a65fdeec47abdb1c2467720967f63.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/712a65fdeec47abdb1c2467720967f63.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your plants grow over time, unfolding leaf by leaf as you care for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/533e648e4be05038120df19dee981034.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/533e648e4be05038120df19dee981034.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/533e648e4be05038120df19dee981034.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone knows what they\u2019re looking for. Sometimes customers bring unusual or tricky requests. Finding just the right plant to fit their needs adds a fun challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/7e8949aa6e2f3ab6836b3aa38ba18a75.poster.avif?t=1774106944\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/7e8949aa6e2f3ab6836b3aa38ba18a75.webm?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/extras/7e8949aa6e2f3ab6836b3aa38ba18a75.mp4?t=1774106944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your shop with a variety of unlockable items, from shelves to plant pots. Pick colors that fit your mood and create a space that reflects your unique style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, care for, and sell 100+ unique plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover plant variegations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your shop with a variety of pots, furniture, and decoration options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill orders and help customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks to progress your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your shop\u2019s reputation to unlock new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are working hard and pouring our hearts into making Leafy Corner. You can support us by wishlisting and following the game on Steam. And if you want to chat with us or fellow plant lovers, you can find us on Discord!</i></p>","developers":["Fireline Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558600/c530cb4d9a41ee6328aae7d536d45fdc0259d789/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774106944","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Leafy Corner \u00a9 2025 Fireline Games Sp. z o.o. All rights reserved. Leafy Corner and Fireline Games are trademarks or registered trademarks of Fireline Games Sp. z o.o. All other trademarks, copyrights, and logos are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3558600/780142412/49f87966572e3c3b881de161bd551047c99269a7/1750599103/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756199853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3558600/780142412/49f87966572e3c3b881de161bd551047c99269a7/1750599103/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756199853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3558600/780142412/49f87966572e3c3b881de161bd551047c99269a7/1750599103/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756199853","id":2